jobs.description:
Are you a friendly and service-minded person who enjoys helping others? Are you good at organizing tasks and making sure everything runs smoothly? Join our team in Enkhuizen and support our Facility Coordinator during an important workplace transformation.

What are you going to do?
As a Facility Support Coordinator, you will support the daily facility activities at our location in Enkhuizen. You will work closely with the Facility Coordinator and help employees and visitors with their questions and needs.

Key responsibilities:

- Support the Facility Coordinator with daily tasks and activities;
- Help with the implementation of the new office environment;
- Support the introduction of the unmanned reception concept;
- Support employees and visitors with facility-related questions;
- Help organize workplace and facility services;
- Work with different teams and stakeholders;
- Make sure tasks are completed correctly and on time;
- Find practical solutions when problems occur.

What do we offer?
- A temporary position to support the current Facility Coordinator;
- You will work 7.6 hours per day, Monday to Friday;
- The position is based on-site in Enkhuizen;
- Salary of €17.50 gross per hour (around €2,880 gross per month);
- 38 hours per week;
- 8.33% holiday allowance;
- Pension plan from the first day of employment;
- Access to the Adecco Academy for further personal and professional development.

Where will you work?
You will work for a large international company at its location in Enkhuizen. The location focuses on s​eed processing and offers a professional and dynamic working environment.

The workplace is currently going through an important transformation. As Facility Support Coordinator, you will help make sure employees and visitors receive the right support during this period.

